From: Ash Hart <71890694+ashhart@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: Backport native SSE keepalives onto the pinned DeepSeek engine

Adapted from ashhart/TensorFold cc8575039b191df20d7739713b77744f462221c4.
The pinned handler opens the response before generate; heartbeat emission starts
only after that successful open, preserving its existing refusal behavior.

